# Bounded nested zero-argument definitions. These exercise declaration-time
# visibility and nested shadowing without parameterized local functions.
def f: . + 1; def g: def g: . + 100; f | g | f; (f | g), g
3.0
106.0
105.0

def f: 1; def g: f, def f: 2; def g: 3; f, def f: g; f, g; def f: 4; [f, def f: g; def g: 5; f, g]+[f,g]
null
[4,1,2,3,3,5,4,1,2,3,3]
